oved CASA (+200bps QoQ), manageable ECL (<2% net worth), and attractive ~1.5x FY27 P/B support outlook.","summary":"UBS maintains Buy on Kotak Mahindra Bank with ₹500 target due to Q4 PAT beat, higher PPOP, and lower credit costs.\nSteady loan/deposit growth, improved CASA (+200bps QoQ), manageable ECL (<2% net worth), and attractive ~1.5x FY27 P/B support outlook.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-05-04T09:08:17","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"619095","title":"Bernstein sets Kotak Mahindra Bank's target price at ₹500, citing strong FY26 with NIM expansion (13bps QoQ).\nSteady loan growth (16% YoY) and RoA >2% noted, but lower RoE (12.3%) limits upside due to high capital buffers.","summary":"Bernstein sets Kotak Mahindra Bank's target price at ₹500, citing strong FY26 with NIM expansion (13bps QoQ).\nSteady loan growth (16% YoY) and RoA >2% noted, but lower RoE (12.3%) limits upside due to high capital buffers.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-05-04T09:08:10","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"619160","title":"Brokerages set over 30% target for Kotak Mahindra Bank, remaining bullish.","summary":"Brokerages set over 30% target for Kotak Mahindra Bank, remaining bullish.","url":"https://x.com/CNBC_Awaaz/status/2051143038853120329","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-05-04T09:03:03","source":"CNBC-AWAAZ"}]}]